{"id":"soeben","lemma":"soeben","pos":"adv","rank":2563,"glosses":["just now, quite recently (moments ago)"],"ipa":"/zoːˈʔeːbən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/00/De-soeben.ogg/De-soeben.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich habe soeben meinen Job verloren.","en":"I just lost my job.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"to opine, to think"},{"g":"job"},{"g":"lost, missing"}]},{"text":"Ich wurde soeben gefeuert.","en":"I just got fired.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},null,{"g":"to fire","l":"feuern"}]},{"text":"Ich habe soeben die Nachrichten gesehen.","en":"I just saw the news.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"news"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"}]},{"text":"Der Zug ist soeben angekommen.","en":"The train has just arrived.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"train"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"to arrive","l":"ankommen"}]},{"text":"Ich habe soeben eine Schlange berührt.","en":"I just touched a snake.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"snake"},{"g":"to touch","l":"berühren"}]}]}